    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about \"hard seasons\" though. i've tried things. i've tried everything. it's like every time i take a step forward, the interest rates or some new bill just drags me ten steps back. it's a loop. a loop that never ends. i feel like i'm just waiting for the inevitable. i'm just so tired of fighting something that's clearly won.",
