    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i dont want to talk to people. everyone is just gonna look at me like i'm a failure. and the more i talk, the more real it gets. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be quiet. i feel like i'm cornered and there's just no way to actually break the cycle without... without something permanent happening.",
